flowchart LR
    R[REQ-* Requirement] --> B[CMP-* / IFACE-* Blueprint]
    B --> P[Plan task]
    P --> I[Coder implementation trace]
    I --> C[Candidate SHA]
    R --> V[VER-* Verification obligation]
    B --> V
    V --> T[Tester test/evidence mapping]
    C --> T
    T --> E[Candidate-bound evidence]
    E --> M[Traceability matrix]
